README.md
# CodexImmortal Dashboard

A copy-pasteable React + Tailwind dashboard demo for the CodexImmortal ecosystem.

## Included
- Sidebar with Agent Lifecycle Management
- CRUD flow for agents: list, add, edit, terminate
- Interactive Task Orchestration Log with simulated WebSocket updates
- Auto-scrolling live log stream
- Responsive dashboard layout with CSS Grid and Flexbox
- Mock data and local state management

## Run
```bash
npm install
npm run dev

